{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://fcc-record/governance/schemas/v1/locked-body.schema.json",
  "title": "FCC Capital Instrument \u2014 Locked Body (v1)",
  "description": "Fields frozen at FILED/LOCKED, taken verbatim from Capital Instrument Specification v0.1.1 \u00a71 'Locked body'. Envelope fields (lock_sha256, ots_anchor, state, terminal_disposition, outcome, process, informational_outcome, ordering_evidence, disputed, trivial, annexes, corrections_refs) are explicitly NOT part of this schema \u2014 they live outside the locked bytes by frozen design and are forbidden here via additionalProperties:false.",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "instrument_id",
    "instrument_type",
    "decision",
    "thesis",
    "evidence_chain",
    "risk_statement",
    "horizon",
    "resolution_criteria",
    "resolution_sources",
    "conflicts_disclosures",
    "doctrine_version",
    "filed_at",
    "schema_version"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "instrument_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^FCC-I-[0-9]{6}$"
    },
    "instrument_type": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "qualification-stance",
        "process",
        "allocation"
      ]
    },
    "decision": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "thesis": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "evidence_chain": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "source_url",
          "retrieved_at"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "source_url": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "retrieved_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "content_sha256": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
          },
          "query": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "snapshot_value": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "note": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "minItems": 1
    },
    "risk_statement": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "sizing": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "book_pct",
        "sector",
        "denomination"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "book_pct": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "sector": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "denomination": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "horizon": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "date-time"
    },
    "resolution_criteria": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "criterion_id",
          "statement",
          "comparator",
          "threshold",
          "evaluation_procedure"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "criterion_id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "statement": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "comparator": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "threshold": {},
          "evaluation_procedure": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "resolution_sources": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "criterion_id",
          "primary_source",
          "registry_class"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "criterion_id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "primary_source": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "fallback_source": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "registry_class": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "benchmarks": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "null_baseline",
        "passive_comparator",
        "composition_snapshot"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "null_baseline": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "passive_comparator": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "composition_snapshot": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "conflicts_disclosures": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "base_rate_note": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "doctrine_version": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "filed_at": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "date-time"
    },
    "schema_version": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "allOf": [
    {
      "if": {
        "not": {
          "properties": {
            "instrument_type": {
              "const": "allocation"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "instrument_type"
          ]
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "sizing": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "instrument_type": {
            "const": "allocation"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "instrument_type"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "sizing"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "$comment": "ENCODING CHOICE (documented, not an architecture-decision stop): N/A conditional fields (sizing, benchmarks) are represented as omission, never null, within this versioned schema. sizing is schema-forbidden outright for non-allocation types per Doctrine H1 Stage-0 N/A; benchmarks remains unconstrained (no mechanical rule distinguishes 'comparative' from 'non-comparative' stance instruments in the frozen text). EVIDENCE FLOOR (owner/ChatGPT final closure, BUILD 02.1): evidence_chain minItems:1 applies UNIVERSALLY to every instrument_type -- qualification-stance, process, and future allocation. For process instruments, a qualifying item is any authoritative source, governing artifact, prior record, measurement, proposal, specification, or correction the decision materially depends on -- not market-price or performance evidence. All existing per-item evidence structure and conditional fields (content_sha256/query/snapshot_value) are unchanged."
}